#: ../../tools/signor_tools.rst:69 59795998e10141568912a37aef896161
msgid "**Name**: ``SIGNOR_get_pathway``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/signor_tools.rst:71 c3596a36ddd54a45bb437ca90fd3dd4d
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get all signaling interactions in a specific SIGNOR "
"curated pathway. Returns the network of causal relationships with "
"effects, mechanisms, and literature references. Use pathway IDs from "
"SIGNOR\\_list\\_pathways (e.g., 'SIGNOR-AD' for Alzheimer, 'SIGNOR-C' for"
" cancer-related)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/signor_tools.rst:75 a3c81e7f5a91480dac34c02462caa7ce
msgid ""
"``pathway_id`` (string) (required) SIGNOR pathway identifier (e.g., "
"'SIGNOR-AD' for Alzheimer, 'SIGNOR-AML' for Acute Myeloid Leukemia, "
"'SIGNOR-AMPK' for AMPK signaling). Get IDs from SIGNOR\\_list\\_pathways."
msgstr ""

