#: ../../tools/signor_tools.rst:103 53e5bcb4b09244bc84d567f304417455
msgid "**Name**: ``SIGNOR_list_pathways``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/signor_tools.rst:105 224ad6586d6f4f69936ba2230303bc16
msgid ""
"**Description**: List curated signaling pathways in the SIGNOR database. "
"Optionally filter by keyword to find pathways related to diseases "
"(Alzheimer, AML), biological processes (apoptosis, autophagy), or "
"signaling (MAPK, PI3K). Returns pathway IDs that can be used with "
"SIGNOR\\_get\\_pathway."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/signor_tools.rst:109 2361082a58484dfcbe6c27e5f7c64c6a
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (optional) Optional keyword to filter pathways by name"
" or description (e.g., 'cancer', 'apoptosis', 'AML'). Leave empty to list"
" all pathways."
msgstr ""

